<!--
    A bike outside the stations, on the map of a journey that sets off from it
    (SPEC §7.2.1, §7.4).

    The station's own disc, drawn smaller: a bike is one bike, it bears no
    count, and the difference in size is what tells it from the rack it stands
    beside on the same map. The glyph, the ring and the hues are the station
    marker's, so the two read as the same family rather than as two drawings.
-->
